# Copy to .env (never commit .env) before `docker compose up`.
#
# The database password is not here: scripts/init_secrets.sh writes it to smo/secrets/db_password, which compose
# mounts as a secret (PR-SEC-4.3).

# Optional. Postgres logs every statement slower than this many milliseconds (-1 turns it off, 0 logs all).
# POSTGRES_SLOW_QUERY_MS=500

# Optional. The address consumers outside the compose network reach R1 Termination by. Unset, /bootstrap names SME on the
# compose network (http://sme:8000). With the tls profile set it to the HTTPS door, e.g. https://localhost:8443, and /bootstrap
# advertises https://localhost:8443/sme/... instead (PR-SEC-1.6). An origin only: no path.
# R1_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://localhost:8443
